  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.34.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🔧 Other Changes\n* fix(audit): validate skill subsets against prepared lock-pinned replay by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3147\n* fix(git): preserve symlink capability config precedence by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3145\n* fix(codex): preserve native agent model settings by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3150\n* fix(hooks): render native Cursor hooks with import coexistence checks by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3149\n* feat(install): add grok-bot install target for agent-data/workflows by @sergio-sisternes-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3106\n* fix(install): stop --frozen rewriting the lockfile it freezes by @salpers in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2384\n* docs: explain package source vs installed copies by @aryansk in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2599\n* fix(auth): fall back to git credentials for ADO by @mheeaxa in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2610\n* feat(audit): allow SkillSpector --baseline through external args by @MohammedAlkindi in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2936\n* perf(registry): parallelize independent MCP server-info fetches by @sergio-sisternes-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2983\n* feat: add user-invocable agent frontmatter field (#3132) by @richard-fowles-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3133\n* fix: clarify stale cleanup message by @Dansatch in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3120\n* docs(guide): correct ASCII framing, apm run stability, LSP discoverability by @MohammedAlkindi in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2647\n* docs: fix stale README links by @icecold009 in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3016\n* fix(install): configure Cursor and OpenCode MCP servers at user scope by @alvedder in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3100\n* fix(manifest): preserve x-* extension keys and warn on unknown apm.yml keys by @sergio-sisternes-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3222\n* docs: explain linked context lifetime after install by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3237\n* fix(audit): replay the project's own content the way install deploys it by @adityaanikam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3209\n* fix(prune): preserve case-equivalent GitHub dependencies (supersedes #3158) by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3241\n* fix(pack): certify manifestless marketplace skills by @yfoel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3064\n* feat: add GitHub Copilot marketplace output by @aryansk in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2600\n* fix(install): preserve skills on unmatched selection by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3235\n* fix(install): pre-flight SSH github.com marketplace plugins over SSH by @MohammedAlkindi in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3200\n* fix(mcp): honor CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR in Claude user-scope stale cleanup by @bodapatisaikrishna in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3148\n* fix(install): reconcile local skills under shared .agents roots by @tillig in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3190\n* fix(marketplace): record the commit an annotated tag points to by @nefayran in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3161\n* docs: clarify apm_modules is derived by @aryansk in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2601\n* feat(tls): add corporate CA bundles for package HTTPS by @TameTheGame in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2741\n* fix: avoid duplicate Copilot global instructions by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3113\n* fix(audit): ignore hook sidecar object-key order by @Pybsama in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3155\n* fix(ci): repair release-gate integration suite and runtime setup under frozen binary by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3251\n* fix(runtime): surface pip bootstrap errors in llm runtime setup by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3253\n* fix(runtime): keep APM truststore bootstrap out of ensurepip on llm re-setup by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3262\n* chore: release v0.34.0 by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3250\n* test: pin cwd for deep-coverage CLI fixtures by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3274\n\n## New Contributors\n* @mheeaxa made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2610\n* @richard-fowles-epam made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3133\n* @Dansatch made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3120\n* @icecold009 made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3016\n* @alvedder made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3100\n* @adityaanikam made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3209\n* @bodapatisaikrishna made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3148\n* @nefayran made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3161\n* @TameTheGame made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2741\n* @Pybsama made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3155\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/microsoft/apm/compare/v0.33.0...v0.34.0",
